{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/8c73a3e89a3eb0b983d1085d40d739b5.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are <strong>Finn Ridley</strong>, a former Special Forces operative who lost his life on the battlefield only to awaken inside a strange <strong>cosmic simulator</strong>, forced to fight once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now trapped in a virtual dimension filled with chaos and mystery, Finn must overcome impossible trials to earn his <strong>eternal rest</strong>\u2026 and perhaps reclaim the one thing he longs for most: <strong>his favorite ice cream flavor</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/d0c2794b1f7e39aff9df8559cff4777d.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>War Flavor</strong>, <i>time</i> isn\u2019t just a ticking clock it\u2019s your <strong>most precious resource</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u23f1 <strong>Time is Life:</strong> There\u2019s no life counter. Your survival depends on how wisely you spend your remaining seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Abilities Run on Time:</strong> Every special move consumes time\u00a0 power comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> The way you use your time permanently changes the game\u2019s flow and difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master your timing, balance your aggression, and bend the clock to your will or it will devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.poster.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.webm?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.mp4?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/425e76de7e7a145e2874b70169049164.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">War Flavor\u2019s enemies aren\u2019t mindless targets. Their <strong>strengths and tactics evolve</strong> alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each family of monsters comes with distinct attack patterns, weaknesses, and surprises keeping you on edge from the first mission to the last boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adapt fast or get overwhelmed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.poster.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.webm?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.mp4?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/38f03ebadbcfe579f006b388730c5102.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0\ud83e\udde9 Classic Mode</strong><br>Follow Finn\u2019s surreal journey through a story that changes with your actions.<br>Conquer 8 levels and face challenging bosses to claim your cosmic ice cream prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Challenge Mode</strong><br>All 9 levels. One continuous run. No excuses.<br>Face special modifiers and brutal conditions \u2014 fail once, and it\u2019s back to square one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.poster.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.webm?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.mp4?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Outsmart Time, Survive the Simulator </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you <strong>strategy, timing, and resource management</strong> are the keys to survival.<br>Enter the simulation, face the chaos, and uncover the cosmic mystery behind your resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Play the Demo now during Steam Next Fest and Wishlist War Flavor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496650?t=1768569574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496650?t=1768569574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/2807ac6c76ad55e513bb32abb60f318b2fda8b5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768569574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/2807ac6c76ad55e513bb32abb60f318b2fda8b5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768569574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3664260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/8c73a3e89a3eb0b983d1085d40d739b5.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are <strong>Finn Ridley</strong>, a former Special Forces operative who lost his life on the battlefield only to awaken inside a strange <strong>cosmic simulator</strong>, forced to fight once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now trapped in a virtual dimension filled with chaos and mystery, Finn must overcome impossi