 to claim your cosmic ice cream prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Challenge Mode</strong><br>All 9 levels. One continuous run. No excuses.<br>Face special modifiers and brutal conditions \u2014 fail once, and it\u2019s back to square one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.poster.avif?t=1768569574\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.webm?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.mp4?t=1768569574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Outsmart Time, Survive the Simulator </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you <strong>strategy, timing, and resource management</strong> are the keys to survival.<br>Enter the simulation, face the chaos, and uncover the cosmic mystery behind your resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Play the Demo now during Steam Next Fest and Wishlist War Flavor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ArteGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/31230a205106f8cc56575e51107bc03afc564286/header.jpg?t=1768569574","is_free":false